// M5-A3P-1014. Ch21 H08 "Sefir lets go" (C, 2 min). GOODBYE: SEFIR'S, TO KESH. act3_ending.md §2 H08.
// Kesh, already lifting, doesn't take his hand. He finally watches her go, and he lets her. Then he lifts too, and his
// last expression is RELIEF. NO SPEECH LONGER THAN TWO LINES. His reflection in the water ripples for the first time in
// the game (his revenant tell, undone). `the_letting` thinning to one held note.
title: ch21_sefir_lets_go
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@camera HT14
@anim sefir reach_for kesh
@vfx glimmer_lift at=kesh_far count=20 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
Sefir [grief]: Kesh. #line:ch21_letsgo_001
@wait 3.0
@anim sefir lower_hand
@wait 2.0
Sefir [tender]: Go on, then. #line:ch21_letsgo_002
@camera HT15
@anim sefir reflection_ripples
@vfx glimmer_lift at=sefir count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@letterbox off
===
